# Scope prettier ignore to the runtime-generated outputs under .qfai so SSOT
# sources (.qfai/specs, .qfai/assistant, .qfai/contracts, .qfai/discussion)
# stay formatted. Negate authored files that we commit (README.md, the
# preflight summary, evidence markdown files that become part of the
# traceability record) so prettier still keeps them readable. Parent
# directories are also explicitly un-ignored so the negated file entries
# survive prettier's gitignore-style matching.
.qfai/report/**
!.qfai/report/
!.qfai/report/README.md
!.qfai/report/preflight_summary.md
.qfai/review/**
!.qfai/review/
!.qfai/review/README.md
.qfai/evidence/**
!.qfai/evidence/
!.qfai/evidence/README.md
!.qfai/evidence/*.md
pnpm-lock.yaml
tmp
*.min.js
*.min.css
